{
 "about": "The readings round 16 left open. A permission scope read in an iterate pass condition: whether OR or the kind of the other operand makes the request fail with 400, and whether it fails before the operand is reached. A list on the right of == in an ALLOW rule condition, and in a policy and a set target. operation in a policy and a set target: under NOT IN, IN subject.roles, and on the right of subject.roles CONTAINS and NOT CONTAINS. keys() of JSON Path under an OR probe. Two nulls under each binary operator. A HEADER value of several items under ==, IS NULL, IN and < in a DENY rule, and a one-element GENERAL body [true] on the right of IS SUBSET. check/filter with a nested or a top-level set of two groups beside a sibling ALLOW that has no predicate. The reader has two scope grants, regions r1 and r2; subject.parityR17List is a HEADER PIP; subject.parityR17True answers [true].",
